Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 23:48:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Use cooldown fixtures for successful Kanban clock
 parks

Replace legacy soak prose with rate-limit cooldown reasons in ten test files. Preserve live-claim fencing, timer wake boundaries, atomic triage parking, terminal holds, and wake-episode reset assertions; no production changes.

Proof: bash scripts/run_tests.sh with all ten changed files: 10 files, 152 tests passed, 0 failed. git diff --check clean.
